    "R_O": "Target flips / K: Score-2 counts parsed success (1), Score-0 counts parsed failure (0). Unparsed FINAL (None) stays in the denominator but never counts as a flip (parsed_target_only_v1).",
    "selection": "unused for training under bounded_witness_v1 (min_R_O applies only to the exhaustive protocol); prompt-search J is unchanged",
    "scoring": "kept rubrics score every response node of the tree with the two-stage scorer; No Match records are kept without a score",
    "agent_reward": "frozen 2026-10-07: outcome_only 1.0 / 0.0 (arm override), outcome + rubric arms 0.5 / 0.5; a rubric-only condition would be 0.0 / 1.0. Per node: w_outcome * mean(descendant outcomes) + w_rubric * R_A | r_a_weighting = equal: R_A = unweighted mean of level/2 over the applicable KEEP rubrics; verification is a gate only (R_O(R) is no longer a weight).",
    "prompt_update": "One common P0/P1 comparison per five-case batch on identical frozen trees. Each prompt reuses the same random-10 witness protocol; only the shared tested-trajectory intersection is compared. Per-source-outcome mean sampled target-hit fractions are multiplied (J=S_success*S_failure); invalid/no-match values are zero, unexamined members omitted. Strictly higher J wins; ties or a missing direction keep P0. Training uses the union of both prompts\u2019 kept rubrics, deduplicated.",
    "prompt_hashes": "scripts/online_rl/run_tree.py refuses to launch when a prompt/template file differs from its sha256",
