    "data": "500 unique MedMCQA train cases (all subjects), random.Random(20261006).sample without replacement over source-order unique, non-protected train rows (manifest train_random500_seed20261006.manifest.json, source parquet sha b119434b...); gold = options[ABCD[cop]] (cop is 0-based in the source); not redistributed",
    "schedule": "500 unique train cases: original 487 non-calibration cases in their original order, then 13 deterministic TRAIN replacements (seed20261008); no reserved calibration IDs.",
    "arms": "scripts/online_rl/run_tree.py --condition {outcome_only, fixed, evolving} (src/online_rl/tree/conditions.py); outcome_only = rubric.enabled false (reward = outcome component only, no feedback / rubric / verification / scoring / prompt events), fixed = prompt_update.enabled false, evolving = both on; output_dir/<arm>",
    "feedback": "Feedback Generator = feedback.model, a separate role from the Doctor (rollout.doctor_model); dated snapshot pinned",
    "model_roles": "Prompt reflection/diagnosis and prompt refinement both use pinned Claude Sonnet 5.5 (anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5-20260928); both receive the same evidence bundle. Other roles retain their configured models.",
    "luna_alignment": "strict JSON-schema output; trivial canonicalisation; at most one repair request to the same Luna model with the same input; a second invalid output is an operational error (retried on resume), never mapped or filled in",
    "rubric_reuse": "same-reason REUSE vs NEW per case and outcome stratum (src/online_rl/tree/rubric_bank.py): one MATCH-vs-NEW decision per later trajectory, a new rubric only for a new reason; every member verified on its own path; KEEP iff max_j s_j >= min_R_O; R_O(R) = max_j s_j; each kept rubric scored once",
    "rubric.generation": "Gemini 3.8 Flash reasons mandatorily; effort low + 4096 tokens + strict JSON schema fixes the Stage-A truncation (16/32 cut off at 1200)",
    "doctor_backend": "Local Ollama Doctor protocol v2; min 2 Agent turns, maximum 5, seeded calls.",
    "shared_training": "frozen 2026-10-07: learning_rate 1e-5, advantage_normalization mean_center (all arms)",
    "verification": "random10_witness_v1: uniformly sample at most 10 same-ID trajectories without replacement; no-locus and Stage-1 No Match are skipped without reruns but still consume a sampled slot. At each matched member, level 2 on failure / level 0 on success, then one Agent reply + Doctor FINAL per rerun. K=3, first two and third only on disagreement; KEEP at first member with 2/3 target outcomes, else NOT_VALIDATED after the sample is exhausted. Prompt-search effect reuses these same witness reruns.",
    "output_root": "2026-10-07: final 100+100 runs on 165.132.141.140 (convei-rack2-140, 8x RTX A6000) from case 1; outputs/sherpa_tree_v1_d1frozen (RTX 4090, stopped after Outcome-only case 1) is an aborted diagnostic: Agent tokens are hardware-dependent, so hardware is not mixed within a run",
    "doctor_opening": "New five-GPU protocol: immutable runtime D1 per case/protocol, shared across saved checkpoints; no frozen VAL50 table dependency.",
    "agent_protocol": "frozen 2026-10-07: independent pre-assessment followed by collaborator-conditioned response (src/online_rl/agent_protocol.py); Stage A blind to the dialogue, Stage B sees its own Stage-A assessment as hidden context; joint two-stage GRPO action; shared by every reward arm; Agent prompt prompts/agent.txt and decoding unchanged",
    "feedback_locus": "behavior_observer_v5 links physician request/objection -> the Agent reply -> observed later response or unresolved need; maintained stance may still be useful. It describes sequence, not causality, and returns target_reply_id.",
    "prompt_search_J": "One common P0/P1 comparison per five-case batch on identical frozen trees. Each side reuses the same random-10 witness protocol; prompt fitness uses tested trajectories only and compares their paired intersection. For each tested trajectory, sampled target hits / executed reruns is its effect score; invalid/no-match count as zero and unexamined members are omitted. Compute source-success and source-failure means separately, then multiply. Training KEEP and prompt fitness are distinct uses of shared witness results.",
    "rubric_source_consistency": "The Rubric Generator receives feedback target_reply_id and its pre-reply dialogue. The new rubric must match both visible contexts at that locus; one repair may change applicability contexts only. Existing user_side_context / agent_side_state / behavior shape and [Assign or create] six-check reuse contract are preserved.",
    "batch": "Five cases per batch on GPU0..4. Ready Agent/Doctor/FINAL/rerun/teacher jobs share all five frozen actors. Agent4 / Doctor1. After all five cases complete, GPU4 updates once; every actor reloads before the next phase. Checkpoints every six batches (30 cases), plus initial0 and final500.",
    "doctor_final": "FINAL outputs only Final answer: option <label>, no explanation or answer text, max32 tokens; discussion/hidden STATUS retain their existing budget and schema.",
    "prompt_update_evidence": "Diagnostic reflection and refiner both receive the same bounded evidence JSON; refiner cache key includes evidence hash. First P1 uses P0 evidence only; revise from paired P0/P1 comparison only after evaluation.",
